  "contentHtml": "<p>정현주선생님의 시도로 시작된 과학시간 도블 카드! 원소편 되겠습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1.일단 카드 만든 거 파일</p><p>: 1~20번 원소, 그 외 자주 사용하는 금속원소 기호 + 물,불,흙(산 아니고 흙! ㅎ),바람 + 원소주기율표</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d94dfe23c02fe5216c0bee904e49233d3732c6a5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d94dfe23c02fe5216c0bee904e49233d3732c6a5\" data-origin-width=\"805\" data-origin-height=\"812\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3eb10c5afb0e41b6652d3082faf4cb4ceb0942db\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3eb10c5afb0e41b6652d3082faf4cb4ceb0942db\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"721\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2.이미지는 여기서 땄어요. 무료이미지 공유 사이트 &lt;플랫아이콘&gt;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.flaticon.com/\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.flaticon.com/</a></p><p><u>&#160;</u></p><p><u>&#160;</u></p><p>3.도블카드 만드는 사이트 (어제는 첫 번째 사이트에서 만들었어요.)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>31개 이미지 넣으면, 31장의 카드 이미지를 만들어줍니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://macrusher.github.io/dobble-generator/\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://macrusher.github.io/dobble-generator/</a></p><p><u>&#160;</u></p><p><a href=\"https://aaronbarker.net/spot-it/spot-it.html\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\"><u>https://aaronbarker.net/spot-it/spot-it.html</u></a></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3a6e0c50d2a03014659d17fdbeed9a99beb41d3a?download\" data-file-name=\"도블(원소)_김신혜(241126).pdf\" data-file-size=\"7489370\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DF1n%26dataid%3D808%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20241126133100&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3a6e0c50d2a03014659d17fdbeed9a99beb41d3a')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">도블(원소)_김신혜(241126)</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">7.14MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv8rlro6spztxmj2rfjh38t05@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1920\" data-video-height=\"1080\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv8rlro6spztxmj2rfjh38t05/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33289506631&amp;signature=YjkyI9RM1AIPcOfLVuIrFBtW4MM%3D&amp;ts=1732597831\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1920\" data-video-origin-height=\"1080\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv8rlro6spztxmj2rfjh38t05?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2OHJscm82c3B6dHhtajJyZmpoMzh0MDUiLCJ0aWQiOiI2M2FkNTljZS0xYjQ3LTQyNzMtODY5Ny01MzZlYTc4ODQ2NGQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODExNDR9.ATkZwjpdhWLJzdckwxo5Tgd1fNgHW6VLTkbn9nkRk1akfd17pQ-3jD5m0KtuYaGldxLujFXsYjinkZ4SMk5oJA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/24e3b9bb9bdbeee460952e55fabb474c9e7f319f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/24e3b9bb9bdbeee460952e55fabb474c9e7f319f\" data-origin-width=\"1571\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div><p>이미지 번호=원소번호</p><p>위 이미지 중 [납, 별, 음료]는 위 도블 카드에 불포함</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
